{"channelId":"UCSlXOw5SCOedsn3mYz49VQQ","row":["Arrive & Thrive",46,"Hi, welcome to the Arrive & Thrive channel 👋\n\nWho are we: \nWe are a career education social enterprise based in Australia. \n\nOur mission: \nTo enable every individual to design and develop a meaningful career and live a fulfilling life.  \n\nOur Podcast: \nThe Arrive & Thrive Career Podcast was created initially by two mates, Daniel Lunardi & Tyson Day, who shared a love for career education and development. After the tragic and unexpected loss of Daniel Lunardi in February 2022, Tyson now continues their vision, inviting people on the show to share stories and learnings in a bid to help others develop meaningful careers and thrive in their chosen pursuits. We commemorate Dan’s soul with the honour segment, “What are you roaring about?” dedicated to the loving memory of Dan. \n\n\nLearn more about Arrive & Thrive at arrivethrive.com.au","","Australia"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSlXOw5SCOedsn3mYz49VQQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSlXOw5SCOedsn3mYz49VQQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:24.151Z","channelId":"UCSlXOw5SCOedsn3mYz49VQQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"2ab9d68a71c40bef20b3d40829b67f3220f4500f1c6b9958d11b66069ef7baf6","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"86d11c7507b2fdf729e65720d926962e07945b33495f63b6c0038ce189d58861"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSlXOw5SCOedsn3mYz49VQQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:47:19.216Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSlXOw5SCOedsn3mYz49VQQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":46,"raw":"46 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSlXOw5SCOedsn3mYz49VQQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:24.151Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chiropractors","relevant":false,"evidenc